#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodsound.rst:21 41fc83bc85ad414e99d76fe01a6481de
msgid ""
"FmodSound is a RefCounted wrapper around FMOD::Sound, representing a loaded sound resource. "
"It provides access to sound metadata, format information, raw audio data, music-specific "
"controls for tracker formats (MOD/S3M/XM/IT/MIDI), and metadata tags."
msgstr ""
"FmodSound 是 FMOD::Sound "
"的引用计数包装器，表示已加载的声音资源。它提供声音元数据、格式信息、原始音频数据、模块音乐格式（MOD/S3M/XM/IT/MIDI）的专用控制和元数据标签。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodsound.rst:27 ba09672455fe4398a903149bbac5af63
msgid ""
"Use :ref:`load_from_file()<class_FmodSound_method_load_from_file>` to load a sound from disk, or "
"create one through :ref:`FmodSystem<class_FmodSystem>` methods. Once loaded, you can query "
"information about the sound, read raw audio data, or use it with "
":ref:`FmodChannel<class_FmodChannel>` for playback."
msgstr ""
"使用    :ref:`load_from_file()<class_FmodSound_method_load_from_file>`    从磁盘加载音频，或通过    "
":ref:`FmodSystem<class_FmodSystem>`    方法创建音频。加载后，你可以查询音频信息、读取原始音频数据，或将其与    "
":ref:`FmodChannel<class_FmodChannel>`    一起用于播放"

