"Sets the volume of a specific channel in a MOD/S3M/XM/IT/MIDI file, in decibels (dB). This allows"
" individual control over each track/instrument in module music."
msgstr "设置 MOD/S3M/XM/IT/MIDI 文件中某个特定通道的音量，以分贝为单位。这允许对模块音乐中的每个音轨/乐器进行单独控制"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodsound.rst:956 98d9db6cc1c344f09a1c9e0ddd71163f
msgid ""
"\\ **Note:** This only works for module music formats. Valid channel indices are 0 to "
":ref:`get_music_num_channels()<class_FmodSound_method_get_music_num_channels>` - 1."
msgstr ""
"**注意：**    仅适用于模块音乐。有效通道索引范围为 0 到    "
":ref:`get_music_num_channels()<class_FmodSound_method_get_music_num_channels>`    减一。"

