msgid "Returns the volume of a specific channel in a MOD/S3M/XM/IT/MIDI file, in decibels (dB)."
msgstr "返回 MOD/S3M/XM/IT/MIDI 文件中某个特定通道的音量，单位为分贝"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodsound.rst:972 0e430b33394742f5887cbfd6d15ffaf0
msgid ""
"\\ **Note:** This only works for module music formats. Use "
":ref:`get_music_num_channels()<class_FmodSound_method_get_music_num_channels>` to get the number "
