msgid ""
"Sets the relative playback speed for MOD/S3M/XM/IT/MIDI music. A value of 1.0 is normal speed, "
"0.5 is half speed, 2.0 is double speed, etc."
msgstr "设置 MOD/S3M/XM/IT/MIDI 音乐的相对播放速度。数值 1.0 为正常速度，0.5 为半速，2.0 为双倍速度，依此类推"

