msgid ""
"Returns the relative playback speed of MOD/S3M/XM/IT/MIDI music. A value of 1.0 represents normal"
" speed, values less than 1.0 are slower, and values greater than 1.0 are faster."
msgstr "返回 MOD/S3M/XM/IT/MIDI 音乐的相对播放速度。数值 1.0 表示正常速度，小于 1.0 的数值表示较慢，大于 1.0 的数值表示较快"

