#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodsound.rst:1018 1de08be240f548ce85752aae8ab92692
msgid ""
"Adds a sync point at the specified position in the sound and returns its handle. Returns ``0`` on"
" failure. Sync points trigger the "
":ref:`FmodChannel.syncpoint<class_FmodChannel_signal_syncpoint>` signal during playback when "
"reached."
msgstr ""
"在声音的指定位置添加同步点并返回句柄，失败时返回    ``0``   。播放到同步点时触发    "
":ref:`FmodChannel.syncpoint<class_FmodChannel_signal_syncpoint>`    信号。"

