#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodsound.rst:1032 e536c508d8ff46caa0a0aac7eebf106a
msgid ""
"Removes a sync point from the sound. The ``point`` parameter should be a handle obtained from "
":ref:`get_sync_point()<class_FmodSound_method_get_sync_point>` or "
":ref:`add_sync_point()<class_FmodSound_method_add_sync_point>`. Returns ``true`` on success."
msgstr ""
"从声音中删除同步点。   ``point``    应为    :ref:`get_sync_point()<class_FmodSound_method_get_sync_point>`"
"    或    :ref:`add_sync_point()<class_FmodSound_method_add_sync_point>`    返回的句柄。成功时返回    "
"``true``   。"

