"Returns the number of sync points in the sound. This includes both sync points embedded in the "
"audio file (e.g., cue points) and ones added with "
":ref:`add_sync_point()<class_FmodSound_method_add_sync_point>`."
msgstr ""
"返回声音中的同步点数量，包括音频文件中嵌入的标记和通过    :ref:`add_sync_point()<class_FmodSound_method_add_sync_point>`    "
