#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodsound.rst:683 256a0004433a408bb2448ee02435cd8d
msgid ""
"Returns ``true`` if this wrapper holds a non-null FMOD Sound pointer. For nonblocking sounds,"
" use :ref:`get_open_state()<class_FmodSound_method_get_open_state>` to check loading "
"progress."
msgstr ""
"如果包装器持有非空的 FMOD Sound 指针，则返回  ``true`` 。对于非阻塞加载的声音，应通过  "
":ref:`get_open_state()<class_FmodSound_method_get_open_state>`  检查加载进度。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodsound.rst:695 6f0d9f2694a14aadb168fdd823f1356d
msgid "Returns ``true`` if this wrapper holds no FMOD Sound pointer."
msgstr "如果包装器没有持有 FMOD Sound 指针，则返回  ``true`` 。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodsound.rst:873 cee4145c96b34d72bbafce382daa0aed
msgid ""
"Locks a region of the sound buffer and returns a :ref:`FmodSoundLock<class_FmodSoundLock>` "
"for reading copies of the PCM data. ``offset`` and ``length`` are measured in bytes. Returns "
"``null`` if locking fails."
msgstr ""
"锁定声音缓冲区的一段区域，并返回用于读取 PCM 数据副本的  :ref:`FmodSoundLock<class_FmodSoundLock>` 。 ``offset``  和  "
"``length``  以字节为单位。锁定失败时返回  ``null`` 。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodsound.rst:875 04218c48f3cd4acebf1e52652bdfe035
msgid ""
"Keep this sound alive until the lock is unlocked. Modifying arrays returned by "
":ref:`FmodSoundLock<class_FmodSoundLock>` does not modify the sound buffer."
msgstr "解锁前必须保持此声音存活。修改  :ref:`FmodSoundLock<class_FmodSoundLock>`  返回的数组不会修改声音缓冲区。"

